    "config": {
      "$doc": [
        "The intent, in words: you have just unloaded at the top of Red Dog Express,",
        "skied right off the ramp for about a second down the Snow King Road bench,",
        "and stopped on the flat facing down Champs Elysees. Press W and you commit.",
        "",
        "Measured at the shipped default (arcFromTopM 16):",
        "  - the lift top terminal is 21.7 deg of raw hillside — you cannot stand there",
        "  - s0+16 m along the road is 8.9 deg on a groomed cat-track bench",
        "  - the ground's own fall line there bears -157..-167 deg; the Champs entry",
        "    bears -161.5 deg. Facing the run IS facing downhill, so W commits and",
        "    gravity agrees with you."
